      "writtenOn": "2023-07-07T14:21:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we instead call this from `rand::init` and re-implement `fill_with_entropy` (and its syntactic sugar `random_array`) with calls to (the Rust function wrapping) `RAND_bytes` so that client code starts using the PRNG without modification?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 169,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 169,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "d5879d7e72f397ad8a06d4556beeeea440c96233",
